        "title": "The picture shows the process of making wool. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The picture shows the process of making wool. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<p><em><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">The picture shows the process of making wool. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Wool Production Process</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i Wool Production Process y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất len từ l&ocirc;ng cừu.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Wool Production Process với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất - len - cừu.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WjPydfrQ3oLXupxfanGlJ2V0gnf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZyjTd1z8bogxVRxeknAlJuGbgub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh c&oacute; nhiều giai đoạn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HDlVdMB5Loe7mZxWHGblKO3Hgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu với việc x&eacute;n l&ocirc;ng cừu v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c với việc sản xuất c&aacute;c sản phẩm từ len</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IggedROYVov7Zgx59LqlfzyygIg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 4 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CU9vd610ioWlBHxNL2tl1t3QgZd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QskudaEUAoU8dKxMvfclL5l4gcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu với <strong>việc chăn nu&ocirc;i cừu (the rearing of sheep)</strong>, sau đ&oacute; l&agrave; <strong>cắt l&ocirc;ng cừu (wool shearing)</strong>, v&agrave; ở đ&oacute; bước n&agrave;y n&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n <strong>lấy l&ocirc;ng (remove the wool)</strong> từ ch&uacute;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YmIVdHvuXo7404xOyM2lHIJ6gTf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>L&ocirc;ng th&ocirc; sau đ&oacute; được l&agrave;m sạch để <strong>loại bỏ bụi bẩn v&agrave; tạp chất (remove dirt and impurities)</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VYLSdzP9coQOblxdSbslltcKgLg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tiếp theo, l&ocirc;ng được sấy kh&ocirc; bằng <strong>thiết bị chuy&ecirc;n dụng (specialized equipment)</strong>, chuẩn bị cho giai đoạn tiếp theo.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SJ8ld7x8Xo3vn6x8xA2l2mROgah\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau đ&oacute;, l&ocirc;ng kh&ocirc; trải qua <strong>qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh chải l&ocirc;ng (a carding process)</strong>, sau đ&oacute; <strong>được chải v&agrave; xếp lại (be combed and aligned)</strong>, tạo ra cả c&aacute;c <strong>b&uacute;i len v&agrave; c&aacute;c sợi len (tufts of wool and strings).</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMkndopVwoaDEixxg49laP2Wg5f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 3 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uvwjdgt5noRTkhxUzbolOPofgGe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c sợi len c&oacute; thể được t&aacute;i chế, c&aacute;c b&uacute;i len được <strong>đưa v&agrave;o kho lưu trữ (be placed in storage).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RmwDdDzgXoDoKaxh6bllV4Pggkc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>len trong kho được đưa ra c&ocirc;ng đoạn <strong>quay sợi (yarn spinning)</strong> th&agrave;nh n<strong>hững cuộn len sợi (balls of yarn).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5l7dfPbVo2UvqxIr3QlWAftgQg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">những cuộn len sợi được d&ugrave;ng để<strong> đan (knitting)</strong> hoặc để l&agrave;m ra <strong>c&aacute;c sản phẩm từ len (woolen products).</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
